# MODULE sixteen bit guest dispatch decision
# PURPOSE select next source command position and charge one unit of fuel
# INPUT query count then records of eight bytes each
# INPUT opcode current position two bytes bracket partner two bytes cell value fuel two bytes
# OUTPUT per record status next position two bytes and remaining fuel two bytes
# TAPE cells zero through twenty one hold one query and temporary registers
# PROFILE branch on opening zero skips to after closing
# PROFILE branch on closing nonzero returns after opening
# PROFILE statuses zero success six no fuel ten overflow thirteen invalid opcode
# LIMITATION bracket partner is provided by a previously validated BF bracket map
# LIMITATION transport closure and trusted input authority remain external
# LIMITATION this source computes next command only and does not execute guest effects

